2 CONC y at law.  Value of real estate listed as $3000, value of personal esta
2 CONC te listed as $500. Household consisted of Adair, Margaret E., and Mary E
2 CONC . Wilson; and Mariah and Harriet Allen (domestic servant and her baby).
2 CONT
2 CONT 1880 census
2 CONT Image 5 on Ancestry.com (District 98, Del Norte Twp., Rio Grande Co., C
2 CONC O)
2 CONT Listed as Adair Wilson, age 38, born in Missouri.   Household consisted o
2 CONC f Adair, Bettie, Katie T, Eddie A., and Alva Wilson; Kate Letcher, list
2 CONC ed as a niece; and Maria and Fannie Allen (servant and her baby).
