1 NOTE The birth information for Martha is from the Ancestral File, submitted b
2 CONC y James Hotchkiss.
2 CONT
2 CONT It's a little odd that on Ancestry.com, in "Virginia, Marriages, 1740-1
2 CONC 850", there are two marriages between John Wilson and Martha Woods, one d
2 CONC ay apart.  One on 23 Jun 1817 in Albemarle Co., the other on 24 Jun 181
2 CONC 7 in Augusta Co.   It appears that those were the same marriage, record
2 CONC ed in two different places.  I think the explanation is that the first d
2 CONC ate is for the marriage bond and the second date is for the actual marr
2 CONC iage.  Here is a bit of a letter from Katherine Bushman to James Hotchk
2 CONC iss, dated 11 Nov 1991:
2 CONT
2 CONT The marriage bond of John Wilson and Martha T. Woods is recorded in Alb
2 CONC emarle County, Virginia, dated 23 June 1817.  The Second Marriage Recor
2 CONC d of Augusta County, Virginia, 1813-1850, page 8, married by John McCue o
2 CONC n 24 June 1817.  John McCue was pastor of Tinkling Spring Presbyterian C
2 CONC hurch.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT I obtained a copy of the marriage bond from the Albemarle County Clerk, a
2 CONC nd actually it is dated 24 Jun 1817.  It is for $150 and is stated to b
2 CONC e for a marriage between John Wilson and Martha T. [?] Woods, daughter o
2 CONC f Micajah Woods.
