2 CONT
2 CONT Died -- At the residence of her father, Gen. John Wilson, on the evenin
2 CONC g of the 22nd inst.  Mrs. Susan Anne Ford, wife of Henry Ford Esq., age
2 CONC d 22 years.  Mr. Ford was absent upon his farm in the country, preparin
2 CONC g a future home of his family.  The deceased was a lady of superior min
2 CONC d and accomplishments, of most amiable and lovely disposition, kind to a
2 CONC ll, and desiring to see everybody happy.  She retained her faculties to t
2 CONC he last and bad [sic] adieu to her weeping relatives and friends, witho
2 CONC ut a murmur, her countenance beaming with resignation to the decree of t
2 CONC he all-wise Disposer.  Also on the same day, John Henry, infant son of M
2 CONC r. and Mrs. Ford.  The friends and acquaintances are invited to attend t
2 CONC he funeral, from the residence of Gen. John Wilson, Rincon Point, on Fr
