1 NOTE From the Contra Costa Times, 16 Jan 2010 (obtained from their web site)
2 CONC :
2 CONT
2 CONT James M. Hotchkiss, Jr. Jan. 16, 1927 ~ Dec. 31, 2009 Resident of Lafay
2 CONC ette James M. Hotchkiss, Jr. passed away in his home on December 31.  B
2 CONC orn in Oakland, Jim spent much of his childhood in Healdsburg.  After s
2 CONC erving in the Navy at the end of WWII, Jim returned to the Bay Area to o
2 CONC btain his undergraduate degree at UC Berkeley and later his MBA at Stan
2 CONC ford University.  Jim established his own accounting office, first in O
2 CONC akland and then in Orinda.  Though retired for more than a decade, he s
2 CONC till went to office daily to meet with clients and conduct genealogical r
2 CONC esearch.  Jim could be counted on for many things, but his Hawaiian shi
2 CONC rts and propensity to never resist the opportunity for a good (or bad) p
2 CONC un were legendary.  He was an avid fan of musical theater and eagerly a
2 CONC waited football season every fall.  Jim loved his family, past and pres
2 CONC ent.  Spending hours researching his family tree, he was eager to share s
2 CONC tories about his pioneering roots and wrote three books highlighting th
2 CONC e lives of some of his more colorful relatives: First Lady of Tennis: H
2 CONC azel Hotchkiss Wightman; A Pair of Kings and a Joker; and The Millionai
2 CONC re Miner and the Indian Girl.  But it was his immediate family that he t
2 CONC reasured above all else.  Jim is survived by his wife of 61 years Isabe
2 CONC l, his sons Joseph and wife Rose of Knightsen, and Edward of Lafayette.  H
2 CONC e was extremely proud of his grandchildren Sarah Hotchkiss, Beth Hotchk
2 CONC iss, and Marion Merrill; and adored his great-grandchildren Samantha an
2 CONC d Cheyanne.  In lieu of flowers, donations can be sent to Contra Costa F
2 CONC ood Bank, Planned Parenthood or the Nature Conservancy.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT He is the author of the Hotchkiss manuscript.  He is also the source of m
2 CONC ost of the Ancestral File information I cite.  I have some information o
2 CONC n other ancestors of his.
