2 CONT There is a Francis Wilson with wife Esther in the 1940 census in San Bu
2 CONC enaventura, Ventura Co., CA, who seems likely to be the right person.  H
2 CONC e is about the right age and lived in San Francisco in 1935 (our Franci
2 CONC s was living with his parents in San Francisco in the 1930 census).  Pl
2 CONC us, his mother, Alice, died in Ventura County, and she could have gone t
2 CONC here to live with her son.  There are family trees on Ancestry.com that s
2 CONC how Francis A. Wilson with the right birth date married to Dorothy Mabe
2 CONC l Preston -- but not till after 1940 because she was not married yet in t
2 CONC he 1940 census.  I don't know if this was a second marriage, or if one o
2 CONC r both of these is the wrong Francis Wilson.
