1 NOTE Birth place name is uncertain, but Chewelah is closest I have found to t
2 CONC wo versions of the birth place (Chwheela from her Social Security appli
2 CONC cation, Shohuilla from a death notice in the Riverside Press-Enterprise
2 CONC ).  In addition, a birth record for her in "Washington Births 1907-1919
