1 NOTE From Johnson Co. KS, museum web site (http://www.jocohistory.org/cdm/si
2 CONC ngleitem/collection/jcm/id/2059/rec/7):
2 CONT
2 CONT Turner Wilson Reid, M.D. (1883-1949) was born in Slater, MO. Education a
2 CONC t Missouri University and Kansas City School of Medicine. He first stud
2 CONC ied pharmacy then went into medicine. He graduated in 1907. He married E
2 CONC rma Helen Orear. They had three daughters: Mary Helen Reid Foster, Chlo
2 CONC ris Reid Harper, and Jane Reid Betros. He practiced in Wellsville from 1
2 CONC 908-1918. He was interested in the oil business from 1918-1933. He bega
2 CONC n practice again in Gardner in 1933 until he was killed in a car accide
2 CONC nt in 1949.
