2 CONC pbell Co, Va., in 1823. Came to Mo. in 1848 and engaged in business for h
2 CONC is cousin, Wm. D. Swinney, at one time near Glasgow, and later in Fayet
2 CONC te, Mo. In 1854 went to Calif. for his health, where he prospered; retu
2 CONC rned in 1865 and settled in Fayette. Died there, Sept 30, 1882. Married f
2 CONC irest [sic], Mollie Burrus, of Va., by whom he had a daughter, still li
2 CONC ving. After several yrs as a widower, he married Mrs. Bell of Saline Co
2 CONC , Mo. by whom he also had a daughter. By J.O. Swinney. (published 10/25
2 CONC /1882)
