2 CONT
2 CONT There are papers on Find A Grave (http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.
2 CONC cgi?page=pv&GRid=9122599&PIpi=9703469) about his enlistment and units i
2 CONC n the Civil War.  He was a private in Company I of the 3rd Missouri Vol
2 CONC unteer Infantry under Capt. McIlvain.  He enlisted on 11 Jan 1862 in Gr
2 CONC eene Co., MO.  On 1 Apr 1863 he transferred from Company F.  He served i
2 CONC n the Missouri State Guard in Poindexter's regiment, 4th division.  It m
2 CONC entions battles in Altoona, New Hope Church, Ga.
