2 CONC usband and went by Elizabeth Ray most of her life.  There is an entry f
2 CONC or her in "U.S. Social Security Applications and Claims Index 1936-2007
2 CONC " on Ancestry.com, with her name given as Elizabeth Ray Hellem and her p
2 CONC arents listed as James Mooney and Pearl Ewers.  It also has a note that s
2 CONC ays her name was listed as Elizabeth Ray Hellem in March 1942 and as El
2 CONC izabeth Ray Burch in November 1942, which seems to imply that her secon
2 CONC d marriage was in 1942.  Emil didn’t die until 1979, so they must have g
2 CONC otten divorced.
2 CONT
