2 CONC upported herself and her two daughters Tamsin Hellem and Delvan Burch b
2 CONC y working at the Grand Theater and later at the Miami Inspiration Clini
2 CONC c and Hospital.  Located on the second floor of the Miami Valley Bank B
2 CONC uilding in the early 1950s, the Miami Inspiration Health Dispensary ser
