2 CONT
2 CONT Vaughan, Charles Welles
2 CONT Charles "Chick" Welles Vaughan - Pueblo Chieftain - September 03, 1986 - C
2 CONC harles "Chick" Welles Vaughan, late of 10 Wallflower Court, passed away S
2 CONC ept. J [sic], 1986, on the island of Maul [sic], Hawaii. Mr. Vaughan wa
2 CONC s a member of BPOE 90 and worked for the Dixon Paper Co. for 15 years. S
2 CONC urvivors include his wife, Bernadette Vaughan, the family home; son, Ti
2 CONC mothy Vaughan of Pueblo, Charlie Vaughan of Denver; stepdaughters, Mich
2 CONC elle and Denise Knicklebine of Pueblo Vaughan; parents, Virgil and Sall
2 CONC y Wilson Vaughan, a brother, Michael William (Deborah Denise) Vaughan, a
2 CONC nd an uncle, Harry Powell Wilson, all of Denver. Funeral services will b
2 CONC e at 2 p.m. Saturday in the Adrian Comer Garden Chapel, with the Rev. O
2 CONC . T. Jackson officiating. Interment will be at the Brookside, Rye Cemet
2 CONC ery. The family may be contacted at 10 Wallflower Court.
